content:
The datasheet describes a single SKU (OP13GI4-005D): one 800G OSFP DR4 module. Applications list 800G Ethernet, OSFP MSA, OIF-CMIS 5.1, and IEEE 802.3dj together—not separate selectable modes. Optical specs use four lanes (λ0–λ3); “DR4” matches four lanes. There is no mode table, no second model, and no separate amplified/unamplified rows. Values 4.0 and 4.2 in the excerpt are transmit power/OMA limits, not distinct receiver-overload modes; eight lanes are not supported as a separate configuration here.

